function fillResponsibleFromStudent(){const map=[['#studentResponsibleName','#studentName'],['#studentResponsibleBirth','#studentBirthDate'],['#studentResponsibleSex','#studentSex'],['#studentResponsibleDocument','#studentDocument'],['#studentResponsibleRg','#studentRg'],['#studentResponsibleSocialName','#studentSocialName'],['#studentResponsibleCep','#studentCep'],['#studentResponsibleAddress','#studentAddress'],['#studentResponsibleNumber','#studentAddressNumber'],['#studentResponsibleDistrict','#studentDistrict'],['#studentResponsibleCity','#studentCity'],['#studentResponsibleState','#studentState'],['#studentResponsibleWhatsapp','#studentWhatsapp'],['#studentResponsiblePhone','#studentPhone'],['#studentResponsibleEmail','#studentEmail']];map.forEach(([target,source])=>{const t=$(target),s=$(source);if(t&&s)t.value=s.value});const financial=$('#studentResponsibleFinancial'),pedagogical=$('#studentResponsiblePedagogical');if(financial)financial.checked=true;if(pedagogical)pedagogical.checked=true;toast('Dados do aluno repetidos no responsável.')}
